# Repository files that are not part of the website (brand and analytics
# docs, the README, Pages Functions source and tests) are never served.
/README.md    /  302
/docs/*       /  302
/functions/*  /  302
/tests/*      /  302

# ARRVD invitation links (https://futodama.app/arrvd/invite/<id>#<token>)
# open the app directly via iOS Universal Links when it is installed —
# this rule only ever applies to a browser that did NOT hand the link to
# the app (not installed, or opened via Safari/an in-app browser that
# skipped Universal Link handling). 200 (rewrite, not a redirect) so the
# URL — and therefore the token in its fragment, which is never sent to
# this or any server — stays exactly as the user opened it.
/arrvd/invite/*  /arrvd/invite-fallback.html  200

# ARRVD guardian links (https://futodama.app/arrvd/guardian/<requestId>#<token>)
# are pasted into the app ("For guardians"); they are not Universal Links, so
# opened in a browser they land here. 200 (rewrite) for the same reason as
# above: the token after "#" stays only in the visitor's address bar. The
# page reads nothing from the address and checks nothing (STEP 110-10AA).
# Not /arrvd/guardians/ (the published guardians page) — a different path.
# The target has no ".html": Pages redirects a "*.html" address to its
# extension-less form, which turned the rewrite into a redirect (seen on the
# preview of 33ac07d).
/arrvd/guardian    /arrvd/guardian-link  200
/arrvd/guardian/   /arrvd/guardian-link  200
/arrvd/guardian/*  /arrvd/guardian-link  200
